{"version":1,"key":"card:471","content":{"id":471,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"1b0cbdaf-3d80-40db-a0c8-13acda41accb","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要在属性被访问时执行一段代码，必须使用一些魔法方法。由下面的四个魔法方法定义。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"94ff5cb3-0de6-4c39-81cf-949b57695178","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c864b8b7-69df-42fc-882c-fc5d39e2a917","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"ad0980a4-3d8c-4030-96dc-12d126b8c84c","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattribute__(self, name)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在属性被访问时自动调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"cdec36e8-8cb1-4136-a73a-bc3d9153c238","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"38939747-121f-4e49-8d57-e81b0ae7fe4c","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattr__(self, name)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在属性被访问而"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"collabId":"f74dc4d7-f95e-42f8-9a91-defdf5e12a62","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对象没有这样的属性时"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"自动调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"88018600-5ac0-4e2c-8650-2b159b4de30c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"eb9beb6e-dd1f-4d6d-b244-847e9849dc9a","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__setattr__(self, name, value)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：试图给属性赋值时自动调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"401c89cf-5b99-4024-8e4c-30316d04f701","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"86402505-4f1d-42c5-91d1-6569cf884b93","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__delattr__(self, name)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：试图删除属性时自动调用"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"48e0ded4-a101-4244-a730-59c8c5430efe","collabId":"5f7b1bd7-6c3f-4ca1-b234-72781a47ddf1","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Rectangle:\n    def __init__ (self):\n      self.width = 0\n      self.height = 0\n    def __setattr__(self, name, value):\n      if name == 'size':\n          self.width, self.height = value\n      else:\n          self. __dict__[name] = value\n    def __getattr__(self, name):\n      if name == 'size':\n          return self.width, self.height\n      else:\n          raise AttributeError()"},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"f59ce1e8-7535-4a3b-bf62-e89e0bf80117","collabId":"25568597-c239-4d84-992c-86c15c5f7c38","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Stats:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._count = 0\n\n    def __getattribute__(self, name):\n        if name == \"_count\":\n            return super().__getattribute__(name)\n        self._count += 1\n        return super().__getattribute__(name)\n\ns = Stats()\ns.name = \"Alice\"\nprint(s.name)    # 访问属性时记录访问次数\nprint(s._count)  # 输出: 1"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"88204d31-443e-447c-bd5c-ed955172c0f5","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"property"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这些魔法方法使用起来要棘手些，在可能的情况下，还是使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"property"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 吧。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","collabId":"d091c760-0bc5-49ce-903b-a1f3bd244a69","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"1a3b632e-8cb4-461d-9ec3-13d98929e44b","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"编写 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattribute__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 需要避开无限循环陷阱。由于它拦截对所有属性的访问（在新式类中），因此将拦截对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__dict__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的访问！"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"b976f19e-7101-488c-9639-c010eaead1a5","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattribute__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中访问当前实例的属性时，唯一安全的方式是使用超类的方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattribute__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）。"}]}]}],"tags":["Python/魔法方法"],"createTime":1719276760702,"updateTime":1791474923040,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923040}}